# A scan that re-reads the policy per value judges values by different policies.
MODULE: JudgedByStartPolicyReadsLivePolicy
TARGET: JudgedByStartPolicy
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: each value is judged by the tree's current policy
PERTURBS: Step

--- FIND
           d == Verdict(scanPolicy, v)
--- REPLACE
           d == Verdict(policy, v)
--- END
